053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"延华观","author":"陈岩","text":"五百年间岸谷移，邯郸枕上梦回时。\n兔葵燕麦玄都观，好继刘郎旧日诗。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17519,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百丈潭","author":"陈岩","text":"目观溶溶眩水精，耳根虩虩受雷声。\n一杯更吸潭间味，并要胸中领此清。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17520,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"百丈箭","author":"陈岩","text":"飞瀑舂撞破的馀，速如蓬矢脱桑弧。\n谁知水底天吴伯，曾识人间金仆姑。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17521,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"老人峰","author":"陈岩","text":"佝偻形容古貌浑，旁连众岭似儿孙。\n荒山太古万万古，眼见游人来几番。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17522,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"西洪岭","author":"陈岩","text":"众壑中分岭势回，数家茅店傍山开。\n长风吹入松梢去，一片笙簧动地来。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17523,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"观音岩","author":"陈岩","text":"一性圆时万境通，三生绮念堕真空。\n如今举眼无非佛，身在光明法界中。","collection":"宋","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"宋_2.csv","pointer":17524,"sha256":"803c6a90ea341892bf1b9f1a81277053e512e8f979efc9c41cd59a283ba061d3","dynasty":"宋"}},{"title":"访山亭","author":"陈岩","text":"又拚